sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor O as Operator
    participant R as CampaignRunner
    participant S as RunStore
    participant G as GitHub API

    R->>S: Commit create_pr intent and correlation key
    R->>G: POST /repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls
    Note over R,G: GitHub may create the PR before the response is lost
    Note over R,S: The runner stops before saving the PR number

    O->>R: Resume the same run_id
    R->>S: Load the open creation intent
    R->>G: Look up repository, base, branch, and relevant states
    G-->>R: Remote lookup result

    alt Exact PR verified
        R->>S: Attach the PR and close the intent
        R-->>O: Continue collecting on the existing PR
    else Lookup unavailable or result ambiguous
        R->>S: Mark needs_attention and retain intent
        R-->>O: Show the required verification or attachment
    else Absence confirmed by reconciliation policy
        R->>S: Authorize a retry under the same correlation key
        R->>G: Create the PR with the expected branch
        G-->>R: Response or outcome to reconcile
    end
